# =============================================================================
# Venture Sourcing Engine
# =============================================================================
#
# This application requires NO environment variables.
#
# There are no API keys, tokens, or credentials, because there are no external
# services to authenticate to. The site is fully static: the research corpus is
# bundled at build time, and all workflow state lives in the visitor's browser.
#
# This file exists to make that explicit and contains no variable assignments.
# If a real variable is ever added, copy this file to .env.local and never
# commit the copy. Every .env file is gitignored; only this template is tracked.
#
# Never place a real credential behind a NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix. Anything with that
# prefix is inlined into the browser bundle and is public by definition.
